# Required: vision model that does the actual facility detection, and the
# second-opinion validation check. Get a key at
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys (needs a funded/paid account -- this
# task costs about $0.26 total for all 25 schools plus the 8-school
# validation subset at current gpt-5.4 / gpt-4o pricing).
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides -- defaults in src/config.py are fine for this task.
# Avoid gpt-5.5 / gpt-5.5-pro here: tested head-to-head, they default to
# heavy internal reasoning that made a single image call take 85s-150s+,
# versus ~4s for gpt-5.4 -- the wrong tradeoff for a repeated batch call.
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.4
# SECOND_OPINION_MODEL=gpt-4o

# Optional: only for validation/second_opinion_claude.py (cross-vendor check,
# about 25 image calls). Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
